<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks up to 12,000 tonnes vegetable oil.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks up to 12,000 tonnes vegetable oil.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia will tender on Wednesday for the purchase of up to 12,000 tonnes of soy and/or rapeseed oils for October/November delivery, the state-buying body Office National de l'Huile said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the tender was in lots of 3,000 or 6,000 tonnes to be delivered on October 5-20 and November 5-20. --Tunis newsroom -- 2161-787538</p>
